Title: Installer installs jitera-pentest into ~/.jitera-pentest/bin, with Jitera messages, repo and links
Why: Installed a strix binary into ~/.strix/bin from usestrix/strix, linked to Strix Cloud, and removed any strix on PATH (pipx uninstall strix-agent), which could delete a real upstream Strix install.
Upstream-PR: none

